  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 337 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows protamine sulfate has been listed since 2021-04-20 and remains listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our product label identifies Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC (FEI 1450022) as the manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1123748 at that plant ended 2020-05-18 and was classified OAI, with the classification letter dated 2024-05-22.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI inspection occurred 337 days before FDA posted the shortage on 2021-04-20.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later FDA inspection 1174894 at the same plant ended 2022-06-30 and was also classified OAI, with classification letter dated 2024-04-30.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The most recent inspection 1216183 ended 2023-08-24 and was classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from HF Acquisition Co LLC, DBA HealthFirst, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    }
  ]
}
